WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sofia Alvarez: The mid-market campaign targets manufacturing and retail accounts with two hundred to two thousand employees.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rachel Kim: What's the handoff process for leads that score above the sales-ready threshold?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sofia Alvarez: Those route directly to sales development within one business day automatically.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Marcus Lee: Let's make sure reps know the messaging pillars so follow-up calls stay consistent.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Sofia Alvarez: I'll share the campaign brief with the full sales team before launch next week.
